#, python-format
msgid ""
"Thank you for signing this petition, an email has just been sent to you at "
"your address %(email)s in order to confirm your signature.<br>You will need "
"to click on the confirmation link in the email.<br>If you cannot find the "
"email in your Inbox, please have a look in your Spam box."
